@startuml UC6_ExploreStory_UseCase
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Story Mode System" {
  (Enter Story Mode)
  (Load Chapter/Location)
  (Display Story Narrative)
  (Narration Screen)
  (Choose Story Action)
  (Read Narrative)
  (Explore Location)
  (Talk to NPC)
  (Battle Trainer)
  (Story Progression)
  (Discover Items/Pokemon)
  (Encounter Battles)
  (NPC Interaction)
  (Receive Quest/Info)
  (Special rules/rewards)
  (Update Story State)
  (Mark Milestone Reached)
  (Unlock Next Chapter?)
  (Advance)
  (Unlock new areas/events)
  (Continue Current)
}

Player --> (Enter Story Mode)
(Enter Story Mode) --> (Load Chapter/Location)
(Load Chapter/Location) --> (Display Story Narrative)
(Display Story Narrative) --> (Narration Screen)
(Narration Screen) --> (Choose Story Action)

(Choose Story Action) --> (Read Narrative)
(Choose Story Action) --> (Explore Location)
(Choose Story Action) --> (Talk to NPC)
(Choose Story Action) --> (Battle Trainer)

(Read Narrative) --> (Story Progression) : <<include>>
(Explore Location) --> (Discover Items/Pokemon) : <<extend>>
(Explore Location) --> (Encounter Battles) : <<extend>>
(Talk to NPC) --> (NPC Interaction)
(NPC Interaction) --> (Receive Quest/Info)
(Battle Trainer) --> (Special rules/rewards)

(Story Progression) --> (Update Story State) : <<invoke>>
(Discover Items/Pokemon) --> (Update Story State) : <<invoke>>
(Receive Quest/Info) --> (Update Story State) : <<invoke>>
(Special rules/rewards) --> (Update Story State) : <<invoke>>

(Update Story State) --> (Mark Milestone Reached)
(Mark Milestone Reached) --> (Unlock Next Chapter?)

(Unlock Next Chapter?) --> (Advance) : Yes
(Unlock Next Chapter?) --> (Continue Current) : No

(Advance) --> (Unlock new areas/events)
(Unlock new areas/events) --> Player
(Continue Current) --> Player

@enduml
